[en.DECISION_MINERAL_EXPLORATION]
Mineral Exploration

[en.DECISION_MINERAL_EXPLORATION_desc]
Carry out the exploration of mineral resources in the territory to find potential crystal or other mineral mines.

[zh.DECISION_MINERAL_EXPLORATION]
矿产资源勘探

[zh.DECISION_MINERAL_EXPLORATION_desc]
在属地开展矿产资源勘探，寻找可能的水晶或其他矿物产出。
